```mdl
decision D-22: Operation keys are stored, resolved and matched in their bare form (`org.example.op`); an operation's own `dxn:` key and an invocation's bare key name the same operation. Data-plane compatibility is recorded as an open question. Fills in [D-3].
  date: 2026-10-29
  by: agent:claude-code
